    "scope": "15.h.W adds a native verified full-bundle provider and explicit bundle-file Diff CLI/structured routing. Its current-JSON projection equals the existing local/Git configuration-and-artifact comparison; all ZIP payloads, including receipts, attachments and archives, remain bound and verified in separate provenance. This is not a full-resource or three-way merge equivalence claim. Opaque current JSON resource differences still fail, input bytes are rechecked, and no extraction, fallback, approval or writing is authorized. 15.h.R retains the original bundle observation until Diff completion; errors preserve initial native validation, host and security boundaries, and observed changes never publish a successful diff. These are non-atomic read observations, not locks or write authority."
